---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="skf-site-footer bg-skf-ink text-white">
  <div class="skf-footer-cta bg-skf-blue px-4 py-12">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col items-start justify-between gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-center">
      <div><p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/75">Need help?</p><h2 class="max-w-2xl text-2xl font-bold leading-tight md:text-3xl">We would love to hear from you.</h2></div>
      <a href="/contact/" class="skf-footer-contact rounded bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-skf-blue transition-colors hover:bg-skf-pale focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white">Contact us ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-4 py-14 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:px-6">
    <div class="lg:col-span-2">
      <a href="/" aria-label="Supertouch Kindness Foundation home" class="skf-footer-logo inline-block rounded bg-white p-2"><img src="/assets/205243a8f82d42fb8e97.png" alt="Supertouch Kindness Foundation" class="h-16 w-auto object-contain" /></a>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/75">Supertouch Kindness Foundation is a grassroots nonprofit empowering vulnerable communities across Nigeria through inclusive health, protection, and development programmes.</p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="About SKF"><h2 class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Who we are</h2><ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-white/75"><li><a class="hover:text-white hover:underline" href="/about/">About</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-white hover:underline" href="/our-team/">Our team</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-white hover:underline" href="/career/">Careers</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-white hover:underline" href="/policies/">Policies</a></li></ul></nav>
    <nav aria-label="Our work"><h2 class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">What we do</h2><ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-white/75"><li><a class="hover:text-white hover:underline" href="/our-work/">Our work</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-white hover:underline" href="/impact/">Impact</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-white hover:underline" href="/news-article/">News</a></li><li><a class="hover:text-white hover:underline" href="/donate/">Donate</a></li></ul></nav>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-white/15 px-4 py-5 text-xs text-white/65"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-wrap justify-between gap-3"><span>© {year} Supertouch Kindness Foundation. All rights reserved.</span><span>Powered by Levi Family Consult</span></div></div>
</footer>
